# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment & secrets
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Plaintext env files are secret and never committed — EXCEPT .env.development,
# which holds only safe, no-risk local-dev defaults (loopback URLs, mock
# adapters, the `change-me` JWT key, MinIO's minioadmin/minioadmin). It is
# committed on purpose so a fresh clone runs with zero env setup. Personal
# overrides go in a gitignored .env / .env.local / .env.development.local and
# win over the committed defaults. Real deployed secrets live ONLY in the SOPS
# variants (*.sops), encrypted under the project's AWS KMS key — decryption
# requires kms:Decrypt via IAM, not a key file.
#
# See .sops.yaml + backend/CLAUDE.md § Secrets management for the workflow.
.env
.env.*
!.env.development
!.env.sops

# parcel-bundler cache (https://parceljs.org/)
.cache
.parcel-cache

